scenario: first_place_of_a_kind
A key used for days with no GeoIP database has no countries or ASNs. A first country and ASN during the learning period are only recorded. For a key that finished learning with none, the first it shows afterwards is raised, because a key used only from private addresses has a network and nothing else, and a thief abroad is exactly that. (Installing a GeoIP database later raises one new_country and new_asn per key, which this was me resolves.)

